# suite TCSTGAP enquiry context and ro
ok 1 - An enquiry with no company is refused
ok 2 - An enquiry with no item is refused
ok 3 - A VAT recovery above a hundred per cent is barred
ok 4 - A cost basis that is not a cost basis is refused
ok 5 - The refusal is an error, not a quiet zero
ok 6 - No unit cost is handed back with the refusal
ok 7 - No basis is claimed to have been used
ok 8 - A stale approval state is not carried forward
ok 9 - The enquiry states its currency
ok 10 - The enquiry states its purpose
ok 11 - The enquiry states its effective date
ok 12 - The enquiry states its price-per quantity
ok 13 - A quote estimate is marked provisional
ok 14 - The quote says in words that it is not a valuation
ok 15 - A valuation enquiry is not a provisional estimate
ok 16 - The valuation purpose is kept as asked for
ok 17 - A roll-up with no item is refused
ok 18 - A negative costing lot size is refused
ok 19 - The refusal explains the missing denominator
ok 20 - A boundary that is neither EXPAND nor STOP is out
ok 21 - An unsupported roll-up function is refused
ok 22 - Every roll-up states one valuation boundary
ok 23 - Every roll-up states its currency
ok 24 - A fixed setup charge always has a denominator
ok 25 - The cost date follows the stated effective date
ok 26 - An unheld standard cost is reported as not found
ok 27 - The refusal names the no-substitution rule
ok 28 - An unavailable basis leaves the answer incomplete
ok 29 - No average or last purchase cost is substituted
ok 30 - The extended cost of a missing basis is nothing
ok 31 - An available basis is named on the answer
ok 32 - The answer states where the cost came from
ok 33 - The answer states its approval state
ok 34 - A valuation enquiry is not a provisional estimate
ok 35 - The extended cost is the stated quantity's cost
ok 36 - B1 expanded roll-up is complete
ok 37 - B1 states the boundary it used
ok 38 - B1 material cost is 70.10
ok 39 - B1 fixed setup for the one run is 10.00
ok 40 - B1 conversion excluding the setup is 20.00
ok 41 - B1 charges the fixed setup to the parent once
ok 42 - B1 total for ten good frames is 100.10
ok 43 - B1 cost per good frame is 10.01
ok 44 - B1 divides by the ten good frames planned
ok 45 - B1 reports its costed tree
ok 46 - Every costed line declares its value boundary
ok 47 - At least one line is counted into the total
ok 48 - A stopped roll-up states the STOP boundary
ok 49 - A stopped roll-up expands less than a full one
ok 50 - A subassembly with no cost is not silently expanded
ok 51 - The branch and its components are not both charged
1..51
